      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَثْكَلَ العِذْقُ</span></b>  <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عذق</span> [or <i>raceme of a
palm-tree</i> or of <i>dates</i>] <i>had many</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمَارِيخ</span> [or
<i>fruit-stalks,</i> also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَثَاكِيل</span>, whence the verb].
